{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>ותחתיה</b> — And there is a land whose underneath is overturned." "<b>כמו אש</b> — Like a land of sulfur and mountains of fire. And there is a land whose stones are the place of sapphire. Also there is a place — we do not know what is there. Also <b>לא ידעו עיט</b> — it is the bird."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:03:50.110530134Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}